# ${SRC_DIR}/api/

HTTP surface for ${PROJECT_NAME}.

## What lives here

- One subfolder per API version (`${API_VERSION}/`, `v2/`, …).
- Inside each version, one folder per feature, plus the `_feature_template/`
  exemplar.

## Versioning

- New endpoints land in the current version (`${API_VERSION}/`).
- Breaking changes get a new version folder. Old versions stay until
  deprecation is complete.

## Naming

- Version folders are lowercase `v<n>`.
- Feature folders are lowercase, plural where applicable (`users/`, `orders/`).

